# Entries mise-tmpl-gen merges into <project>/.worktreeinclude — the
# allowlist of ignored paths `rwt new` copies into every new worktree (plain
# paths only, no globs). Merging is additive: project-local entries are
# never removed. Comments and blank lines here are ignored.
#
# deps/ and _build/ seed the Mix caches copy-on-write (rwt clones via
# clonefile on APFS), eliminating the fresh-worktree cold start;
# `mix deps.get` + `mix compile` in dev:setup validate the seeded cache.
.config/
.env
.envrc
deps/
_build/
